# Git

## Normal workflow

Check changes:
`git status`

Stage changes:
`git add .`

Commit staged changes:
`git commit -m "message"`

Push commits to GitHub:
`git push`

## Branches

Create + switch:
`git switch -c new_branch`

Switch:
`git switch branch_name`

First push:
`git push -u origin branch_name`

`-u` = remembers the remote branch (upstream)
`origin` = remote repository, usually GitHub

## Pull

Get latest remote changes:
`git pull`

## .gitignore

Example:
`.ipynb_checkpoints/`
`__pycache__/`
`.venv/`
